bea86036-ccde-4a64-968a-03fc2d376b9d	CNTT	Kỹ sư Công nghệ Thông tin	Information Technology Engineer	ky-su-cong-nghe-thong-tin	information-technology-engineer	undergraduate	7480201		active	<p>Chương&nbsp;trình&nbsp;đào&nbsp;tạo&nbsp;Kỹ&nbsp;sư&nbsp;ngành&nbsp;Công&nbsp;nghệ&nbsp;thông&nbsp;tin&nbsp;(CNTT)&nbsp;nhằm&nbsp;đào&nbsp;tạo&nbsp;những&nbsp;kỹ&nbsp;sư&nbsp;có&nbsp;<em>nền&nbsp;tảng&nbsp;công&nbsp;nghệ&nbsp;và&nbsp;kỹ&nbsp;năng&nbsp;thực&nbsp;hành&nbsp;vững&nbsp;chắc,&nbsp;mang&nbsp;tính&nbsp;ứng&nbsp;dụng&nbsp;và&nbsp;liên&nbsp;ngành;&nbsp;được&nbsp;phát&nbsp;triển&nbsp;chuyên&nbsp;môn&nbsp;và&nbsp;đổi&nbsp;mới&nbsp;sáng&nbsp;tạo&nbsp;trong&nbsp;các&nbsp;lĩnh&nbsp;vực&nbsp;thiết&nbsp;kế,&nbsp;triển&nbsp;khai&nbsp;và&nbsp;quản&nbsp;lý&nbsp;hệ&nbsp;thống&nbsp;thông&nbsp;tin,&nbsp;hạ&nbsp;tầng&nbsp;công&nbsp;nghệ&nbsp;và&nbsp;giải&nbsp;pháp&nbsp;số;&nbsp;có&nbsp;khả&nbsp;năng&nbsp;học&nbsp;tập&nbsp;suốt&nbsp;đời&nbsp;và&nbsp;thích&nbsp;nghi&nbsp;với&nbsp;thay&nbsp;đổi&nbsp;công&nbsp;nghệ;&nbsp;có&nbsp;khả&nbsp;năng&nbsp;giao&nbsp;tiếp&nbsp;hiệu&nbsp;quả&nbsp;và&nbsp;hợp&nbsp;tác&nbsp;liên&nbsp;ngành&nbsp;toàn&nbsp;cầu;&nbsp;có&nbsp;trách&nbsp;nhiệm&nbsp;xã&nbsp;hội&nbsp;và&nbsp;đạo&nbsp;đức&nbsp;nghề&nbsp;nghiệp.</em></p>	<p>The&nbsp;Bachelor&nbsp;of&nbsp;Engineering&nbsp;curriculum&nbsp;in&nbsp;Information&nbsp;Technology&nbsp;aims&nbsp;to&nbsp;educate&nbsp;engineers&nbsp;with&nbsp;a<em>&nbsp;strong&nbsp;technological&nbsp;foundation&nbsp;and&nbsp;solid&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;characterized&nbsp;by&nbsp;an&nbsp;application-oriented&nbsp;and&nbsp;interdisciplinary&nbsp;approach.&nbsp;Graduates&nbsp;are&nbsp;equipped&nbsp;to&nbsp;develop&nbsp;professional&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;and&nbsp;foster&nbsp;innovation&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;design,&nbsp;deployment,&nbsp;and&nbsp;management&nbsp;of&nbsp;information&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;technological&nbsp;infrastructure,&nbsp;and&nbsp;digital&nbsp;solutions.&nbsp;They&nbsp;are&nbsp;also&nbsp;expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;demonstrate&nbsp;lifelong&nbsp;learning&nbsp;capability&nbsp;and&nbsp;adaptability&nbsp;to&nbsp;technological&nbsp;changes,&nbsp;possess&nbsp;effective&nbsp;communication&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;ability&nbsp;to&nbsp;collaborate&nbsp;in&nbsp;interdisciplinary&nbsp;and&nbsp;global&nbsp;environments,&nbsp;and&nbsp;uphold&nbsp;social&nbsp;responsibility&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional&nbsp;ethics.</em></p>	b9684a18-aef4-4314-8c6a-9eb0720c0c87
